    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0641" n="629" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg629"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20252/218: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hayes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-18T22:00:00+01:00">November 18,
                            1943—10 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 19—3:36 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3401. My 3323, November 12.<anchor n="46" xml:id="d564-f1"/> I told Jordana this
                    morning that my Government was greatly troubled over the inordinate number of
                    German agents throughout Spain including active Nazi party members, <pb
                        facs="0642" n="630" xml:id="pg630"/> members of the Gestapo, and sabotage
                    and espionage agents. Moreover, we are aware that the number of these agents had
                    increased recently. We are aware also of increasing German pressure on unneutral
                    elements in Falange. I said I would reserve for the future further discussion of
                    this matter in its larger aspects but at this time specifically I wished to
                    state that the United States Government joined the British Government in
                    requesting prompt suppression of the German Consulate General at Tangier and
                    expulsion of German agents from there. I said we had abundant evidence that
                    Tangier is an important base of operations of the German agents I had referred
                    to. I then handed him a note on the subject.</p>
                <p>Jordana limited his reply to saying he would study the note.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Tangier.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hayes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
